  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wtr 201.08 Presiding Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wtr 201.08 Presiding Officer. In all council proceedings in which a hearing officer has not been designated presiding officer, the council chair, acting chair or vice chair, shall serve as presiding officer.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Ec-Wtr 200) #13923, eff 4-11-24",
